  have h1 := hA K d δ ι h2 hd hδ Λ₀ Ω₀ hΛ hΩ E I φ s 𝔣 Q ⟨hE, hφ, hφK, hs, h𝔣, hQ⟩ κ q.out (S q) (hS q)
